text:
 {
  "turns": [
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Thank you for calling Nimbus Telecom. My name is Nisha. How can I help you today?",
      "tags": [
        "greeting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Hi Nisha, I'm Rahul Das. I'm calling because my new phone is constantly dropping calls and I'm just fed up with it.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I am sorry to hear that you are experiencing issues with your device. I can certainly look into that for you. Before we proceed, could you please provide your account number?",
      "tags": [
        "empathy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Sure, it is 30502182.",
      "tags": [
        "identity_verification"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Thank you. I see your account. Now, regarding the device, have you tried restarting the phone or updating the software?",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Yes, I've done all that. It's still not working. I'm tired of paying for a service that doesn't work. I want to cancel my contract now.",
      "tags": [
        "churn_signal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I understand this is frustrating, but I can't cancel the line immediately while the device is under warranty. I need to check the termination terms first.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "I don't care about the warranty. Just cancel it. I'm switching to another provider tomorrow.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "If you choose to cancel now, there is an early-termination fee of fifty dollars, and your final bill will arrive within thirty days of the closing date.",
      "tags": [
        "disclosure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Fifty dollars? That's ridiculous! I'm the one with the broken phone! I want to pay my current outstanding balance now just to get this over with. Here is my card: four nine five two eight five nine zero zero three one four four nine one one.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I have processed that payment. However, I still cannot waive the termination fee or cancel the account right now without a supervisor's approval.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "This is unbelievable. You've done absolutely nothing to fix my phone or my account. I am beyond angry right now!",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I apologize for the inconvenience. Is there anything else I can assist you with today? To summarize, we have processed your payment, but the cancellation remains pending. Goodbye.",
      "tags": [
        "closure"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
